rules:
(stated in docs/methodology.md):
- substance: a statement is dropped when at least 2 of its 3 skeptics refute it;
- dimension: changed only when both readers reject it AND agree on the same other
  dimension; any other disagreement is kept as proposed and flagged for the editor;
- fidelity: when the check fails, its corrected summary/context/gloss replace the draft's;
  the quote is never touched. The replay's gates judge the corrected notes again.
